Package: ffmpeg-rockchip
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: ffmpeg with Rockchip MPP and RGA hardware acceleration
 The ffmpeg and ffprobe command line tools built with --enable-rkmpp and
 --enable-rkrga, which give them the video decoders and encoders of the
 Rockchip VPU and the scaling and overlay filters of the RGA 2D engine.
 .
 This package contains the two tools, installed as ffmpeg-rockchip and
 ffprobe-rockchip with symlinks in /usr/local/bin. The libav* libraries are
 linked in statically, so no shared library is shipped.
